{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_title", "source_sha256": "80a2e8bfb94f637aff1ad7a12d85d61aa168e6d830991d64624310d541d79be2", "ja": "亜利沙とおでかけ2", "zh": "与亚利沙外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0d49a06a1b027051d4dfa227361d64dcae4d2631dabb96e761dbe322427c7e6b", "ja": "亜利沙とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "记录了和亚利沙出门时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "762c75cffe7c4d8280188cecfd44c305bbddfe008dea2522da2ad3cf8dc01916", "ja": "（今日の亜利沙はオフだ。ということで、\n有名な黒部ダムにやってきたのだが……）", "zh": "（今天亚利沙休假，于是来到了著名的黑部水坝，然而……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "222ea76962abc9e8f7164cf5943dde7e6ed7c3d93555fc93f9a1d25c8c8653a2", "ja": "ふぉ……！！　ダム！　ダムすごいですダム！\n大きい！　すごい！　大迫力ですぅ！", "zh": "哇……！！　水坝！水坝好厉害，水坝！\n好大！好厉害！气势十足～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_1002_se", "source_sha256": "013233d6da1687a0858cec1649473f04164587833634c7c5eb970899ba930bc1", "ja": "パシャパシャパシャ……！", "zh": "咔嚓咔嚓咔嚓……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4cd937fa499f83d4114283cb224ba4b6bd8ea5fd367495d12d75a491f490538e", "ja": "（亜利沙がアイドル以外をこんなに\n熱心に撮るのは、珍しい気がするな……）", "zh": "（感觉亜利沙这么专心地拍摄偶像以外的事物，\n还真是少见啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8c418f19762a58b225509d961a0fed43cf527757940846d5478b8ea35fc9897d", "ja": "いやぁ、すごいな、ダム……。\nあっ、亜利沙！　足元に気をつけないと……", "zh": "哎呀，水坝还真是壮观啊……\n啊，亚利沙！当心脚下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "028276e17d9137404a804d8f033cd3f346970066eea69ddb9bfa6e027c01c80a", "ja": "へ？　……ひゃっ！？", "zh": "诶？……呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_1006_se", "source_sha256": "bfd6cf89ddf1962d49a5e5bffd45f426c17fb9de60a3fa8060ef9cf0e9b4ce7b", "ja": "ズルッ！", "zh": "滋溜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "36388f60c5b3dabbb4f89ea48f90b8f0c836c73180ae4507c772ea175123fc59", "ja": "写真を撮るのはいいけど、よそ見してると危ないぞ。\n何にせよ、転ばなくてよかった。", "zh": "拍照是没问题，但要是东张西望的话会很危险哦。\n不管怎么说，没摔倒就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "61c4e024ab4a42027b00ec02231bddae6e6a46c181feade5a6c4b1a03a9ec058", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……ありさ、写真に\n夢中になるあまり、転びそうになっちゃいました……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您……亚利沙刚才太专注于拍照，差点摔倒了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "19d5abac955b423489152d0ab4d0a123c315908b127b1ffb259245ebb7cdfed4", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。もう大丈夫\nなんで……て、手を離してもらっても良いですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生，已经没事了……可、可以请您松手吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f3251c3d9ae082aba4610da53b41db7fa6ead97db1974597511ab9f58b82fd8d", "ja": "あっ、すまない。\n咄嗟に腕を引っ張っちゃったけど、ケガしてないか？", "zh": "啊，抱歉。我刚才一时情急拉了你的胳膊，你没受伤吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "d6a0a1ee644deda2dc292b3dc2722b437174ecd92db4530744783feb770e5fb4", "ja": "だ、大丈夫ですけど、ちょっと、照れちゃったカモ……\nって、ありさ何言ってるんでしょう！？　うわーっ！", "zh": "没、没事，不过，可能稍微有点害羞……\n呃，亚利沙在说什么啊！？呜哇——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "25b2038f5f4a523d57ccec1a492fa98fa9796ba57da975189aba9bdc257f3014", "ja": "あ、亜利沙！？　待ってくれ、どこに行くんだー！", "zh": "啊、亜利沙！？等等，你要去哪儿——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5faae3306f5facb96b0c8f1ffc528a1891bc81a01d68c96bcf76c11564b35e15", "ja": "（逃げる亜利沙を追っていたら、ダムを\n一周してしまった……いい汗かいたな！）", "zh": "（追着逃跑的亚利沙，结果绕着水坝跑了一圈……出了不少汗啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
